-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §48 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה לדרגה השלמה
-- הקרובה: at placement, a teacher at a whole grade has spent 0 years in it,
-- one at an intermediate grade between 1 and 3 a year, between 3 and 9 a
-- year and a half; the first promotion to grades 2–6 is §38(א)–(ב)'s, the
-- criteria fitted to the time left; to grades 7–9 only the years and the
-- criteria, without the evaluation.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `48 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה לדרגה השלמה הקרובה`

-- akn:art_48__para_a The opening of (א): at the placement of §46, (1)–(3).

@ref akn:art_48__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_48__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_48__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years taken as spent in the grade at placement` grade IS
    BRANCH IF FLOOR grade EQUALS grade THEN 0
           IF grade LESS THAN 3 THEN 1
           OTHERWISE 1.5

-- (ב): the first promotion to whole grades 2–6 is §38(א)–(ב)'s; from an
-- intermediate grade, §38(א)(2)'s criteria are fitted to the time left.
-- (ג): the first promotion to 7, 8 or 9 asks only §38(ה)(1)–(2), the years
-- and the criteria, and not the evaluation of (ה)(3).
@ref akn:art_48__para_b akn:art_48__para_c akn:art_48__para_c/p2
GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER, `first promotion after the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the evaluation is asked` `to grade` `first promotion after the conversion` IF
    `to grade` AT LEAST 7 AND NOT `first promotion after the conversion`

#ASSERT `years taken as spent in the grade at placement` 4 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `years taken as spent in the grade at placement` 2.5 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `years taken as spent in the grade at placement` 4.5 EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT NOT `the evaluation is asked` 7 TRUE
#ASSERT `the evaluation is asked` 8 FALSE
